I take my phone.
I write a message to Anitha.
"Hi Anitha, I am in a new café."
"This place is very beautiful."
"The banana cake here is very delicious."
"Do you want a banana cake?"
"I will buy it for you next time."
I send that message.
Anitha's reply comes immediately.
"Will I also get a cake?"
I reply, "Definitely."
Anitha writes again, "I want that cake!"
I smile happily.
I put the phone on the table.
I drink my iced tea again.
